{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {
    "title": "Users",
    "description": "[Download API specification](https://developer.salesforce.com/static/commercecloud/commerce-api/users/users-oas-v1-public.yaml)\n\n# API Overview\n\nThe Users API provides endpoints for managing Business Manager users and their access keys within Salesforce Commerce Cloud.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis API allows administrators to create, retrieve, update, and delete users. It also supports managing access keys for users, retrieving password expiration information, and changing user passwords.\n\n## Key Features\n\n- **User Management**: Create, retrieve, update, and delete Business Manager users\n- **Access Key Management**: Create, retrieve, enable/disable, and delete access keys for users\n- **Password Management**: Retrieve password expiration information and change passwords\n- **User Listing**: Retrieve all users with no filtering\n\n## Access Key Scopes\n\nAccess keys can be created for the following scopes:\n- `WEBDAV_AND_STUDIO`: Access for WebDAV and Studio operations\n- `AGENT_USER_AND_OCAPI`: Access for Agent User and OCAPI operations\n- `STOREFRONT`: Access for storefront operations\n\n## Use Cases\n\n- **Provisioning**: Create and configure Business Manager users programmatically\n- **Key Rotation**: Manage access keys for automated integrations\n- **Security Auditing**: Review user accounts and their access configurations\n- **Password Policies**: Monitor password expiration and enforce password changes\n\n## Authentication\n\nThis API requires OAuth 2.0 authentication with the appropriate scopes:\n- `sfcc.users` - Read access to user resources\n- `sfcc.users.rw` - Read and write access to user resources\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. Use access keys instead of passwords for automated integrations\n2. Regularly rotate access keys for security\n3. Monitor password expiration dates and enforce timely password changes\n4. Use the PATCH endpoint for partial updates instead of PUT for full overwrites\n5. Only externally managed users can have access keys",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "x-api-type": "Admin",
    "x-api-family": "Merchant"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://{shortCode}.api.commercecloud.salesforce.com/merchant/users/v1",
      "variables": {
        "shortCode": {
          "default": "123456gf"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/organizations/{organizationId}/users": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "Get Users",
        "description": "Retrieves all users with no filtering.\n",
        "operationId": "getUsers",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "organizationId",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "An identifier for the organization the request is being made by",
            "required": true,
            "style": "simple",
            "explode": false,
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OrganizationId"
            },
            "example": "f_ecom_zzxy_prd"
          },
          {
            "name": "select",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "style": "form",
            "explode": true,
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Select"
            },
            "examples": {
              "select": {
                "value": "(**)"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Number of records to retrieve per request. Must be between 1 (minimum) and 200 (maximum). Defaults to 25.",
            "required": false,
            "style": "form",
            "explode": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "format": "int32",
              "default": 25,
              "maximum": 200,
              "minimum": 1
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "offset",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Used to retrieve the results based on a particular resource offset.",
            "required": false,
            "style": "form",
            "explode": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "format": "int32",
              "default": 0,
              "minimum": 0
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Returns the collection of users",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UserSearch"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "UserSearchResponse": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/UserSearchResponse"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "AmOAuth2": [
              "sfcc.users",
              "sfcc.users.rw"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/organizations/{organizationId}/users/{login}": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "Get User",
        "description": "Retrieves a single user by their login.\n",
        "operationId": "getUser",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "organizationId",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "An identifier for the organization the request is being made by",
            "required": true,
            "style": "simple",
            "explode": false,
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OrganizationId"
            },
            "example": "f_ecom_zzxy_prd"
          },
          {
            "name": "login",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "The login of the user.",
            "required": true,
            "style": "simple",
            "explode": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "example": "admin-user",
              "maxLength": 256,
              "minLength": 1
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Returns the user details",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/User"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "UserDetails": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/UserDetails"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "User not found",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "UserNotFound": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/UserNotFound"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "AmOAuth2": [
              "sfcc.users",
              "sfcc.users.rw"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "put": {
        "summary": "Create or Replace User",
        "description": "Creates or overwrites a user. If a user with the given login already exists, the existing\nuser will be overwritten. If no such login exists, a new user is created.\n",
        "operationId": "createOrReplaceUser",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "organizationId",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "An identifier for the organization the request is being made by",
            "required": true,
            "style": "simple",
            "explode": false,
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OrganizationId"
            },
            "example": "f_ecom_zzxy_prd"
          },
          {
            "name": "login",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "The login of the user.",
            "required": true,
            "style": "simple",
            "explode": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "example": "admin-user",
              "maxLength": 256,
              "minLength": 1
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "description": "The user to create or replace",
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/User"
              },
              "examples": {
                "CreateUser": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/examples/CreateUser"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The user was successfully updated",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/User"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "UserCreated": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/UserCreated"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "201": {
            "description": "The user was successfully created",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/User"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "UserCreated": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/UserCreated"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Bad Request - Invalid user request",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "BadRequest": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/BadRequest"
                  },
                  "IdConflict": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/IdConflict"
                  },
                  "LocalUserCreation": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/LocalUserCreation"
                  },
                  "PasswordPolicyViolation": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/PasswordPolicyViolation"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "AmOAuth2": [
              "sfcc.users.rw"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "delete": {
        "summary": "Delete User",
        "description": "Deletes a single user.\n",
        "operationId": "deleteUser",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "organizationId",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "An identifier for the organization the request is being made by",
            "required": true,
            "style": "simple",
            "explode": false,
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OrganizationId"
            },
            "example": "f_ecom_zzxy_prd"
          },
          {
            "name": "login",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "The login of the user.",
            "required": true,
            "style": "simple",
            "explode": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "example": "admin-user",
              "maxLength": 256,
              "minLength": 1
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "204": {
            "description": "The user was successfully deleted"
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "User not found",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "UserNotFound": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/UserNotFound"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "AmOAuth2": [
              "sfcc.users.rw"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "patch": {
        "summary": "Update User",
        "description": "Updates a user. The locked flag and the user password cannot be updated with this resource.\n",
        "operationId": "updateUser",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "organizationId",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "An identifier for the organization the request is being made by",
            "required": true,
            "style": "simple",
            "explode": false,
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OrganizationId"
            },
            "example": "f_ecom_zzxy_prd"
          },
          {
            "name": "login",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "The login of the user.",
            "required": true,
            "style": "simple",
            "explode": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "example": "admin-user",
              "maxLength": 256,
              "minLength": 1
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "description": "The user fields to update",
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UserUpdateRequest"
              },
              "examples": {
                "UpdateUser": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/examples/UpdateUser"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The user was successfully updated",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/User"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "UserUpdated": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/UserUpdated"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Bad Request - Invalid user update request",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "BadRequest": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/BadRequest"
                  },
                  "IdConflict": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/IdConflict"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "User not found",
            "content": {
              "application/problem+json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "UserNotFound": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/examples/UserNotFound"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "AmOAuth2": [
              "sfcc.users.rw"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
